ed","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-12-30T11:22:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T16:19:35Z","closed_at":"2026-01-13T16:19:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.1 stable \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Intel(R) UHD Graphics 730 (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.7040) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-14400 (16 threads) - 15.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen preloading or importing a simple project ZIP exported from the desktop Godot editor into the online Web Editor, the editor hangs indefinitely at \"Scanning Files\" if the project contains any PNG or JPG images.\n\nThe entire page becomes unresponsive (browser tab freezes, no interaction possible).\nNo error messages or logs appear in the browser console (F12 > Console).\nHowever, editor plugins (if any) still execute normally – for example, _enter_tree() in a plugin is called successfully.\nIf the ZIP contains no images (only scenes, scripts, project.godot, etc.), the import completes normally without hanging.\nThis makes the Web Editor unusable for any project that includes even a single small image resource.\n\nThis seems specific to resource reimporting/scanning of image files in the browser environment (IndexedDB + WebAssembly limitations?).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the desktop Godot editor (latest stable 4.5.1.stable).\nCreate a new simple project.\nAdd one or more PNG/JPG images to the project (e.g., via FileSystem dock > res:// folder).\nExport the project as a ZIP (Project > Tools > Export Project Source > Save as ZIP).\nGo to [https://editor.godotengine.org/](https://editor.godotengine.org/?referrer=grok.com).\nOn the startup screen, click \"Preload project ZIP\" and upload the exported ZIP.\nCreate a folder when prompted (or let it auto-create).\nThe editor loads, but gets stuck forever at \"Scanning Files\" progress bar, and the page becomes completely unresponsive.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[demo-godot.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24381417/demo-godot.zip)\n\n<img width=\"1053\" height=\"878\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3bbe1460-7192-429e-abc4-bbc4dc6b0139\" />","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114441/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}